THIRD-PARTY LICENSES & LEGAL COMPLIANCE NOTICE
===============================================================================

1. OpenWrt & Linux Kernel Patches, Device Tree, Drivers, and Scripts:
   Licensed under GPL-2.0-only (or dual GPL-2.0 / BSD-2-Clause where explicitly
   noted in individual file SPDX headers).

2. Broadcom BCM63138 RDP / Runner Driver & Microcode
   (`openwrt-overlay/target/linux/bcm63xx_arm/files/drivers/net/ethernet/broadcom/bcm63138_rdp/`):
   Derived from Broadcom's official GPL-released BCM63138 SDK (published under
   Zyxel's GPL source release for VMG8825-B50B). All included source and
   microcode files carry Broadcom's explicit `DUAL/GPL` (GPLv2) license header.

3. Wi-Fi Radio Firmware (NOT stored in this repository):
   Public builds produced by this repository use OpenWrt's standard
   `linux-firmware` packages (`brcmfmac-firmware-4366c0-pcie` and
   `brcmfmac-firmware-43602a1-pcie`), redistributed by upstream `linux-firmware`
   under `LICENCE.broadcom_bcm43xx`.

4. Proprietary Zyxel / Broadcom Bootloader (`cferam`) & OEM Blobs:
   This repository intentionally contains ZERO proprietary Zyxel or Broadcom
   closed-source binaries (`cferam`, OEM `rtecdc.bin`, OEM images, or private
   calibration/MRD dumps). Users supply their own `cferam` locally from their
   own router or an official Zyxel OEM firmware download using the included
   open-source `scripts/vmg8825_factory_builder.py` tool.
